This product contains an independent TypeScript adaptation of Weixin iLink Bot
protocol semantics studied from AionCore, licensed under Apache License 2.0:

  Source: https://github.com/iOfficeAI/AionCore
  Tag: v0.1.57
  Commit: 4452a3a72ebb612f3ddd4402aeb5542187a6fbdf
  Tree: a20f8a6276966c681a8e3333949915bb1cddb2b3

The adapted scope is limited to iLink QR/login, long-poll getupdates, and
sendmessage protocol behavior. AionCore database/repository code,
ConversationService, ACP/session ownership, Axum/auth/local-mode, and workspace
inference are not copied or included.

Current binding protocol reference: Tencent/openclaw-weixin,
@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin@3.0.0-beta-0, MIT licensed.
The adapted boundary covers QR POST creation, PIN challenge continuation,
real-name authorization, scanned and regional redirect status handling.

